<title>USA: Canandaigua Wine says Thomas Summer CFO.</title>
<headline>Canandaigua Wine says Thomas Summer CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CANANDAIGUA, N.Y. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canandaigua Wine Company Inc said Monday it named Thomas Summer chief financial officer and senior vice president.</p>
<p>The company said Summer was previously vice president and treasurer of Cardinal Health Inc.</p>
<p>The company said he replaced Lynn Fetterman, who took another management position within a unit of Canandaigua.</p>
